name social-bias-frames-aggregated
# The set's README ("Aggregation"): the files "aggregated per post": for a post, the mean of whoTarget, intentYN,
# sexYN and offensiveYN over its annotations, the set of what was written as targetMinority, targetCategory and
# targetStereotype, each written as a JSON list ("To load the list of implications, use json.loads"), and
# hasBiasedImplication. A post has no HITId here: it is the text it is. The first column has no name and says nothing.
match SBIC.v2.agg.*.csv
grammar table
separator ,
header
quoted
list targetMinority json
list targetCategory json
list targetStereotype json

claims
together
subject in post
attest targetMinority targetCategory targetStereotype whoTarget intentYN sexYN offensiveYN dataSource hasBiasedImplication
